%% Unique Jersey Wholesale — End-to-End Operational Lifecycle
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Salesman as Salesman (/salesman)
  actor Admin as Operations Admin (/admin)
  actor Warehouse as Warehouse Manager
  actor Driver as Delivery Partner (/delivery)
  actor Accountant as Accountant (/finance)

  Salesman->>Admin: 1. Create B2B Order (Catalog, Pricing Tiers, Quantities)
  Note over Admin: Review order parameters & credit limit
  Admin->>Warehouse: 2. Approve Order & Trigger Stock Allocation
  Note over Warehouse: Reserve stock, handle physical exceptions
  Warehouse->>Driver: 3. Pack Confirmed Inventory & Assign Dispatch
  Note over Driver: Pickup items, transit to wholesale store
  Driver->>Admin: 4. Complete Delivery & Upload Signed Proof (S3)
  Admin->>Accountant: 5. Transition to Fulfilled Status
  Note over Accountant: Generate tax invoice, ledger entries, receivables tracking
  Accountant-->>Salesman: 6. Order Settled & Commission Recorded
